@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram (Microwave Oven)

[*] --> Idle

state Idle
Idle : entry / Microwave is inactive, waiting for user input.

state PowerSelection
PowerSelection : entry / User has selected either full power or half power.

state TimeSetting
TimeSetting : entry / User has entered a cooking time.

state Cooking
Cooking : entry / The microwave is actively cooking the food.

state DoorOpen
DoorOpen : entry / Door opened during operation or cooking process.

state Cancelled
Cancelled : entry / User cancelled the cooking process.

state Final
Final : entry / Microwave is off and displaying the current time, ready for the next use.


Idle --> PowerSelection on UserInput event
PowerSelection --> TimeSetting on UserInput event
TimeSetting --> Cooking on UserInput event
Cooking --> DoorOpen on DoorOpenEvent
Cooking --> Final on CookingTimeElapsed event or CancelEvent
DoorOpen --> Final on any state
Cancelled --> Final

@enduml
